"quotation>` for the product. Upon clicking the :guilabel:`Confirm` button, "
"the quotation turns into a sales order. At that point, an invoice can now be "
"created by clicking :guilabel:`Create Invoice` in the top-left corner. On "
"the *Create invoice(s)* pop-up window that appears, select :guilabel:`Down "
"payment (percentage)`, and type `100` in the :guilabel:`Down Payment` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment.rst:None
