"checking the box beside it."
msgstr ""
"För att aktivera funktionen *Online Signature*, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings`, bläddra till "
"rubriken :guilabel:`Quotations \\& Orders` och aktivera "
"funktionen :guilabel:`Online Signature` genom att markera rutan bredvid den."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:None
msgid ""
"The Online Signature feature option in the Settings of the Odoo Sales "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet Online Signature-funktion i inställningarna för Odoo Sales-"
"applikationen."

#: ../../content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/get_signature_to_validate.rst:23
